      "widgets_values": [
        "motion_transfer:\nsubject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the pixel-art game character in <Picture 1>; preserve its identity, colors, outfit, proportions and chunky pixel-art style.\nsummary:\n[video generation + reference] Transfer the performance of <Video 1> to <Subject 1>, preserving the action order, timing and the locked camera of the guide.\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1>: preserve the reference identity and pixel-art look throughout the clip. Keep the guide's flat #00FF00 background and framing.\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] <Subject 1> follows the guide's motion, poses and body movement in order and at matching times, pinned to the center of the frame at the same size as the guide character. Do not copy <Picture 1>'s still pose as the motion.\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft footstep taps.\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone.",
