        "draftsman": "comfy-draftsman"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Inputs\n\nLoad your source image/media here.\n\nType what you want in the green prompt box(es) here.\n\nMiniMaxH3ImageToVideo takes clip+vae+prompt directly\nand outputs BOTH the positive CONDITIONING and the\nLATENT - there is no separate CLIPTextEncode or empty-\nlatent node in the i2v path. For t2v use\nEmptyMiniMaxH3LatentAV instead.\nMiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo uses <Picture i> / <Video k>\n/ <Audio j> tags - use the same tags in the prompt\ntext.\n\n| knob | now | range / choices | effect |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| width (ImageScale #32) | 544 | 0-16384 | Output width in pixels - usually needs to match the model's trained resolution bucket, or composition degrades. |\n| height (ImageScale #32) | 544 | 0-16384 | Output height in pixels - same caveat as width. |\n| width (MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo #400) | 544 | 32-16384 | Output width in pixels - usually needs to match the model's trained resolution bucket, or composition degrades. |\n| height (MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo #400) | 544 | 32-16384 | Output height in pixels - same caveat as width. |"
      ],
      "title": "Inputs",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
