      "widgets_values": [
        "### Models & LoRAs\n\nSwap models here to change the whole look.\n\nThree parts plus a second VAE. UNETLoader for the\ndiffusion model, CLIPLoader with type=minimax for the\nQwen3-VL 32B encoder, VAELoader for the VIDEO vae, and\na SECOND VAELoader for the AUDIO vae. H3 emits a joint\nvideo+audio latent: decode it twice (VAEDecode with\nthe video vae, VAEDecodeAudio with the audio vae) and\nre-mux with CreateVideo at 24 fps.\n\n| knob | now | range / choices | effect |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| strength_model (Load LoRA: minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0. #64) | 1 | -100.0-100.0 | How strongly the LoRA affects the diffusion model - higher is a stronger stylistic pull, can overpower the base model. |\n| strength_model (Load LoRA: minimax_h3_motion_transfer_tara_ #586) | 1 | -100.0-100.0 | How strongly the LoRA affects the diffusion model - higher is a stronger stylistic pull, can overpower the base model. |"
      ],
      "title": "Models & LoRAs",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
